{"speciesId":100,"names":{"fr":"Voltorbe","es":"Voltorb","en":"Voltorb","ja":"ビリリダマ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"red","text":"Usually found in power plants. Easily mistaken for a POKé BALL, they have zapped many people."},{"language":"en","version":"blue","text":"Usually found in power plants. Easily mistaken for a POKé BALL, they have zapped many people."},{"language":"en","version":"yellow","text":"It is said to camouflage itself as a POKé BALL. It will self-destruct with very little stimulus."},{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"It rolls to move. If the ground is uneven, a sudden jolt from hitting a bump can cause it to explode."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"It was discovered when POKé BALLS were introduced. It is said that there is some connection."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"During the study of this POKéMON, it was discovered that its compo­ nents are not found in nature."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"VOLTORB was first sighted at a company that manufactures POKé BALLS. The link between that sighting and the fact that this POKéMON looks very similar to a POKé BALL remains a mystery."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"VOLTORB is extremely sensitive - it explodes at the slightest of shocks. It is rumored that it was first created when a POKé BALL was exposed to a powerful pulse of energy."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It bears an uncanny and unexplained resemblance to a POKé BALL. Because it explodes at the slightest shock, even veteran TRAINERS treat it with caution."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"A life-form whose identity is unknown. It is said to SCREECH or suddenly SELFDESTRUCT."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"Usually found in power plants. Easily mistaken for a POKé BALL, it has zapped many people."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It looks just like a Poké Ball. It is dangerous because it may electrocute or explode on touch."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It looks just like a Poké Ball. It is dangerous because it may electrocute or explode on touch."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It looks just like a Poké Ball. It is dangerous because it may electrocute or explode on touch."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It rolls to move. If the ground is uneven, a sudden jolt from hitting a bump can cause it to explode."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It was discovered when Poké Balls were introduced. It is said that there is some connection."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il ressemble à une Poké Ball. Ce Pokémon dangereux peut exploser ou s’électrifier au toucher."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It looks just like a Poké Ball. It is dangerous because it may electrocute or explode on touch."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il ressemble à une Poké Ball. Ce Pokémon dangereux peut exploser ou s’électrifier au toucher."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It looks just like a Poké Ball. It is dangerous because it may electrocute or explode on touch."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It looks just like a Poké Ball. It is dangerous because it may electrocute or explode on contact."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It looks just like a Poké Ball. It is dangerous because it may electrocute or explode on contact."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Découvert en même temps que les Poké Balls. Il paraît qu’il existe un lien entre les deux."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Fue descubierto cuando se crearon las Poké Balls. Se dice que tiene algo que ver con ellas."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It was discovered when Poké Balls were introduced. It is said that there is some connection."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"モンスターボールが 売り出されたのと 同じ 時期に 発見された。 なにか 関係があると いわれる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Vivant près des centrales électriques, ce Pokémon survolté est souvent confondu avec une Poké Ball."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Suele vivir en centrales de energía. Mucha gente acaba muy mal al confundirlo con una Poké Ball."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Usually found in power plants. Easily mistaken for a Poké Ball, it has zapped many people."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"発電所などに 現れる。 モンスターボールと 間違えて 触って しびれる 人が 多い。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"La première fois qu’on a vu Voltorbe, c’était dans une usine qui fabrique des Poké Balls. Personne n’a jamais pu expliquer le lien entre cet événement et la ressemblance frappante de ce Pokémon avec une Poké Ball."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Voltorb fue visto por primera vez en una empresa encargada de comercializar Poké Balls. La conexión que existe entre aquella primera vez que se le vio y el hecho de que se parece mucho a una Poké Ball sigue siendo un misterio."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Voltorb was first sighted at a company that manufactures Poké Balls. The link between that sighting and the fact that this Pokémon looks very similar to a Poké Ball remains a mystery."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"モンスターボールを つくっている 会社で 初めて 発見された ことと 姿形が 似ている ことの 関係は まだ ナゾである。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Voltorbe est extrêmement sensible. Il explose au moindre choc. On raconte qu’il fut créé par l’exposition d’une Poké Ball à une puissante dose d’énergie."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Voltorb es tremendamente sensible y a la más mínima sacudida explota. Cuentan que se creó cuando alguien expuso una Poké Ball a una gran descarga eléctrica."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Voltorb is extremely sensitive—it explodes at the slightest of shocks. It is rumored that it was first created when a Poké Ball was exposed to a powerful pulse of energy."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"少しの ショックで すぐに 爆発する。 モンスターボールに 強力な パルスを 浴びせた ときに 生まれたと ウワサされている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"On dit qu’il se déguise en Poké Ball. Il s’autodétruit à la moindre stimulation."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Se dice que se camufla como una Poké Ball. Al más mínimo estímulo se autodestruirá."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"It is said to camouflage itself as a Poké Ball. It will self-destruct with very little stimulus."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"モンスターボールに 似ているのは 保護色の ためだと 言われるが 意外と 簡単に 自爆する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"On dit qu’il se déguise en Poké Ball. Il s’autodétruit à la moindre stimulation."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Se dice que se camufla como una Poké Ball. Al más mínimo estímulo se autodestruirá."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"It is said to camouflage itself as a Poké Ball. It will self-destruct with very little stimulus."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"モンスターボールに 似ているのは 保護色の ためだと 言われるが 意外と 簡単に 自爆する。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"An enigmatic Pokémon that happens to bear a resemblance to a Poké Ball. When excited, it discharges the electric current it has stored in its belly, then lets out a great, uproarious laugh."}],"varieties":[{"id":100,"moves":[{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[10,"tutor",0],[19,"machine",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[1,"level-up",1],[2,"level-up",1],[3,"level-up",1],[4,"level-up",1],[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",5],[9,"level-up",5],[10,"level-up",5],[11,"level-up",5],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",5],[15,"level-up",5],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[19,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1],[28,"level-up",1],[29,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[1,"machine",0],[2,"machine",0],[2